      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We provide ongoing guidance that considers the wider business impact."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We need someone who understands our business, not just individual legal issues.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "External General Counsel support creates continuity."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Rather than repeatedly explaining your business to different advisors, SHAAS develops an understanding of your:"
