      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Allowing us to provide more effective and relevant advice."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We want to become more professional before attracting investors or expanding.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Investors, partners, and stakeholders increasingly expect businesses to have:"
