    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is an External General Counsel?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "An External General Counsel is an outsourced legal advisor who provides ongoing strategic legal support to a business without the need to hire a full-time internal General Counsel."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why would a company choose an External General Counsel?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Many businesses require senior legal guidance but do not have enough legal workload to justify a full-time hire. An External General Counsel provides flexibility, expertise, and cost efficiency."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is an External General Counsel only suitable for large companies?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. This model is particularly valuable for startups, SMEs, family businesses, and growing organisations that require experienced legal support as they scale."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does SHAAS replace external law firms?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. SHAAS can work alongside external law firms where specialised legal expertise or litigation support is required. Our role is to provide ongoing strategic legal guidance and business-focused advisory."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS provide ongoing monthly legal support?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS offers flexible retained advisory arrangements designed around the organisation's requirements."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Strengthen Your Business With Trusted Legal Leadership",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Every growing organisation reaches a point where legal decisions become too important to manage reactively."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "With SHAAS as your External General Counsel partner, your business gains access to experienced legal advisory support that helps you make informed decisions, manage risk, strengthen governance, and pursue opportunities with confidence."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you need ongoing legal support, assistance with strategic initiatives, or a trusted advisor to work alongside your leadership team, SHAAS provides the expertise and flexibility your business needs."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our External General Counsel services can support your organisation's growth and long-term success."
      }
     ]
    }
