        "Hospitality",
        "Retail",
        "Logistics",
        "Professional Services",
        "Family Businesses",
        "Investment Companies",
        "Government & Public Sector"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Our Legal Risk Management Approach",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "Identify",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We understand your business activities, objectives, stakeholders, and areas of potential exposure."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Assess",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We evaluate legal risks based on likelihood, impact, and business importance."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Prioritise",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We identify the risks requiring immediate attention and improvement."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Mitigate",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We develop practical solutions to reduce exposure and strengthen protection."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Monitor",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We support continuous improvement as your organisation evolves."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why Choose SHAAS for Legal Risk Management?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Businesses choose SHAAS because effective risk management requires more than legal knowledge."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "It requires understanding how businesses operate."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Our approach combines:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Business-Focused Thinking",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We consider the commercial consequences behind every legal risk."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Proactive Risk Management",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We help organisations identify issues before they become costly problems."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Practical Recommendations",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We provide clear actions that management teams can implement."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Integrated Advisory Expertise",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Our capabilities combine legal advisory, governance, compliance, strategy, and business consulting."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Tailored Solutions",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Risk priorities differ by organisation, industry, and growth stage."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Long-Term Partnership",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We support businesses in continuously improving their risk resilience."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "What You Can Expect From SHAAS",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Depending on your engagement, deliverables may include:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Legal risk assessment reports",
        "Contract risk reviews",
        "Legal risk registers",
        "Compliance gap assessments",
        "Governance risk reviews",
        "Risk mitigation roadmaps",
        "Internal control recommendations",
        "Legal health reports",
        "Policy improvement recommendations",
        "Management advisory reports"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is legal risk management?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Legal risk management is the process of identifying, assessing, and reducing legal exposures that may affect an organisation's operations, finances, reputation, or strategic objectives."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why should businesses manage legal risks proactively?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Proactive legal risk management helps organisations prevent disputes, reduce unexpected costs, improve decision-making, and strengthen stakeholder confidence."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is legal risk management only relevant for large companies?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. Businesses of all sizes face legal risks. In many cases, SMEs and growing businesses benefit significantly from identifying risks early before they become expensive problems."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How is legal risk management different from legal advice?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Legal advice addresses specific legal questions, while legal risk management takes a broader approach by identifying patterns of exposure and developing strategies to reduce overall business risk."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS conduct a legal risk assessment for our company?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS provides structured legal risk assessments designed to identify vulnerabilities and recommend practical improvements."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Protect Your Business Before Risks Become Problems",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The strongest organisations are not those that avoid risk completely—they are those that understand, manage, and control risk effectively."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses move from reactive problem-solving to proactive risk management by identifying legal exposures, strengthening controls, and supporting better business decisions."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are growing your business, entering new markets, preparing for investment, or strengthening your governance framework, SHAAS provides the legal risk management support required to operate with confidence."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Legal Risk Management Advisory services can help protect your organisation and support sustainable growth."
      }
     ]
    }
