  {
   "title": "LEGAL HEALTH CHECK",
   "subtitle": "A Comprehensive Review of Your Business Legal Position, Risks, and Opportunities for Improvement",
   "sections": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Every business has legal foundations that support its operations."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Your company structure, contracts, governance processes, compliance practices, intellectual property protection, and internal policies all contribute to your organisation's ability to operate effectively and grow sustainably."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "However, many businesses do not regularly assess whether their legal framework remains appropriate as their operations evolve."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A company may continue operating while carrying hidden legal risks:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Outdated agreements",
        "Weak contractual protections",
        "Governance gaps",
        "Compliance exposures",
        "Unclear ownership arrangements",
        "Missing policies",
        "Operational vulnerabilities"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "At SHAAS, we provide Legal Health Check services in the UAE to help businesses understand their current legal position, identify potential risks, and develop a practical roadmap to strengthen their legal foundations."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Our Legal Health Check provides management teams, shareholders, and investors with greater visibility, confidence, and control over their organisation's legal environment."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Understanding Your Legal Health Before Problems Arise",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Just as businesses monitor financial performance, operational efficiency, and market position, they should also regularly assess their legal health."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A Legal Health Check provides an independent review of the key legal areas affecting your business."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "It helps answer important questions:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Are our contracts protecting our interests?",
        "Are our governance structures appropriate?",
        "Are our legal documents up to date?",
        "Are we meeting regulatory obligations?",
        "Are potential liabilities properly managed?",
        "Are we prepared for future growth or investment?"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses move from uncertainty to clarity by identifying risks and providing actionable recommendations."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Business Challenges We Help Solve",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Businesses typically request a Legal Health Check when they face important decisions, growth opportunities, or uncertainty."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps organisations address challenges such as:"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We have never conducted a legal review of our business.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Many companies focus on daily operations and financial performance while overlooking their legal foundations."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Over time, this can create:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Outdated documentation",
        "Unidentified liabilities",
        "Contractual weaknesses",
        "Governance issues",
        "Compliance gaps"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A Legal Health Check provides a structured review of your current legal position."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"Our business has changed, but our legal framework has not.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Businesses evolve."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "You may have:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Expanded operations",
        "Entered new markets",
        "Added shareholders",
        "Changed your business model",
        "Increased commercial relationships"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Your legal framework should evolve accordingly."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS identifies areas where your legal structure requires updating to support your current and future objectives."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We are preparing for investors, financing, or due diligence.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Investors and lenders evaluate legal readiness as part of their decision-making process."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A Legal Health Check helps identify and address potential concerns before they impact:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Investment discussions",
        "Funding processes",
        "Partnerships",
        "Transactions",
        "Valuation"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We want to understand our legal risks before making strategic decisions.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Major business decisions often involve legal consequences."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Before entering into new opportunities, companies benefit from understanding:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Existing obligations",
        "Potential liabilities",
        "Contractual commitments",
        "Regulatory requirements"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS provides the clarity needed for informed decision-making."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We have multiple contracts but no clear understanding of our exposure.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contracts are often one of the largest sources of business risk."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We assess whether agreements:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Protect commercial interests",
        "Allocate risks appropriately",
        "Clearly define obligations",
        "Include necessary protections"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "What Does a SHAAS Legal Health Check Cover?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Our Legal Health Check is tailored according to the organisation's size, industry, and objectives."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The review may cover the following areas:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Corporate Structure & Documentation Review",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We assess whether your corporate foundation supports your business objectives."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Review areas may include:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Company structure",
        "Ownership arrangements",
        "Shareholder documentation",
        "Corporate records",
        "Board documentation",
        "Corporate approvals",
        "Authority structures"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Identifying opportunities to strengthen corporate organisation and governance."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Commercial Contracts Review",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contracts are central to business operations."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We review key agreements including:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Customer contracts",
        "Supplier agreements",
        "Service agreements",
        "Partnership agreements",
        "Distribution agreements",
