    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is a Legal Health Check?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A Legal Health Check is a structured review of a company's legal position, identifying risks, gaps, and opportunities to strengthen its legal framework."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why should my company conduct a Legal Health Check?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Businesses benefit from understanding their legal position before risks become disputes, financial losses, or operational challenges."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How often should a business conduct a Legal Health Check?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The frequency depends on the business size, industry, and level of change. Many growing companies benefit from conducting periodic reviews, particularly before major transactions or expansion."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is a Legal Health Check only for companies with legal problems?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. A Legal Health Check is a proactive assessment designed to identify risks before problems occur and strengthen business foundations."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS help implement the recommendations?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS can support businesses with contract improvements, governance enhancements, compliance frameworks, and ongoing legal advisory support."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Understand Your Legal Position. Strengthen Your Business Future."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Strong businesses do not wait for legal issues to arise."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "They proactively understand their risks, strengthen their foundations, and prepare for future opportunities."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A SHAAS Legal Health Check provides your organisation with the clarity needed to identify vulnerabilities, improve legal readiness, and make confident business decisions."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are preparing for growth, investment, expansion, or simply want greater confidence in your current legal position, SHAAS provides the insight and support required to strengthen your business."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to schedule your Legal Health Check and gain a clearer understanding of your organisation's legal health."
      }
