      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Implement",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We support execution and ongoing improvement."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why Choose SHAAS for Family Business Advisory?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Family businesses require advisors who understand both business and family dynamics."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS provides:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Business Understanding",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We understand the commercial realities of running and growing businesses."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Governance Expertise",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We help families create structures that support long-term sustainability."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Strategic Perspective",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We look beyond immediate issues toward future value creation."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Integrated Advisory",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Our capabilities combine legal, governance, strategy, risk, and business advisory."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Practical Solutions",
     "blocks": [
