      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Long-Term Partnership",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "We support families throughout their business journey."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "What You Can Expect From SHAAS",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Depending on your needs, deliverables may include:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Family governance assessment",
        "Family constitution framework",
        "Succession planning roadmap",
        "Ownership structure review",
        "Shareholder advisory",
