        "Transaction advisory support"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is Family Business Advisory?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Family Business Advisory helps family-owned companies address governance, ownership, succession, strategic, and operational challenges to ensure long-term sustainability."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do family businesses need governance structures?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "As families and businesses grow, governance structures create clarity around decision-making, ownership, responsibilities, and future leadership."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "When should a family business start succession planning?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Succession planning should begin well before a transition is required. Early planning increases the likelihood of a smooth and successful transition."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS help family businesses prepare the next generation?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS supports families in developing structured approaches for leadership transition and next-generation involvement."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does SHAAS work only with large family businesses?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. Governance and succession planning are valuable for family businesses of all sizes, particularly those preparing for growth or transition."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Protect Your Legacy. Strengthen Your Future."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A successful family business is not only measured by what one generation builds, but by what future generations can continue and grow."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps family businesses preserve their legacy by creating stronger governance structures, improving decision-making, preparing future leaders, and building foundations for sustainable growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether your family business is preparing for succession, professionalising operations, resolving ownership challenges, or exploring strategic opportunities, SHAAS provides the advisory support needed to protect and enhance long-term value."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Family Business Advisory services can support your family's business journey."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
