  {
   "title": "COMPANY FORMATION & CORPORATE STRUCTURING",
   "subtitle": "Building the Right Corporate Foundation for Business Growth",
   "sections": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The structure of a company is one of the most important decisions entrepreneurs, investors, and business owners make."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The right corporate structure can support:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Business growth",
        "Investor confidence",
        "Operational efficiency",
        "Risk management",
        "Tax and regulatory considerations",
        "Ownership clarity",
        "Future expansion"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The wrong structure can create unnecessary complexity, limitations, and risks."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "At SHAAS, we provide Company Formation and Corporate Structuring advisory services in the UAE to help entrepreneurs, investors, and organisations establish, restructure, and optimise their corporate frameworks."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Our approach goes beyond company registration. We focus on understanding your business objectives and designing structures that support your current needs while preparing for future growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are launching a new business, expanding into the UAE, restructuring an existing organisation, or creating a group structure, SHAAS provides strategic and practical guidance throughout the process."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "More Than Company Setup: Creating a Foundation for Success",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Starting or restructuring a business involves decisions that can have long-term implications."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Key considerations include:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Ownership structure",
        "Legal entity selection",
        "Shareholding arrangements",
        "Governance requirements",
        "Business activities",
        "Regulatory obligations",
        "Investor requirements",
        "Expansion plans"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A company structure should not only satisfy immediate requirements—it should support where the business intends to go."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps clients make informed decisions by combining corporate advisory, legal insight, governance expertise, and commercial understanding."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Business Challenges We Help Solve",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Businesses seek company formation and structuring support for different reasons."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps address challenges such as:"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We want to establish a company in the UAE but do not know the right structure.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The UAE offers multiple jurisdictions and entity options."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Choosing the right structure requires understanding:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Business activities",
        "Ownership requirements",
        "Investment objectives",
        "Operational needs",
        "Future expansion plans"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps entrepreneurs evaluate options and select a structure aligned with their objectives."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We are entering the UAE market from overseas.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "International businesses entering the UAE need to understand local requirements and strategic considerations."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS supports foreign investors with:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Market entry structuring",
        "Entity establishment guidance",
        "Ownership considerations",
        "Corporate documentation",
        "Regulatory requirements"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Helping businesses establish a strong local foundation."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"Our current corporate structure no longer supports our growth.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "As businesses evolve, existing structures may become inefficient or restrictive."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS assists companies with:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Restructuring assessments",
        "Group structuring",
        "Ownership reorganisations",
        "Corporate governance improvements",
        "Entity rationalisation"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We need a structure suitable for investors or future funding.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Investment readiness requires appropriate corporate foundations."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses establish structures that support:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Investor participation",
        "Shareholder clarity",
        "Governance expectations",
        "Due diligence requirements",
        "Future transactions"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We want to create a group structure or holding company.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Growing businesses often require more sophisticated structures."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS supports:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Holding company structures",
        "Subsidiary arrangements",
        "Business separation strategies",
        "Investment vehicles",
        "Corporate governance frameworks"
