    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is the difference between FP&A and accounting?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Accounting focuses on recording and reporting historical financial transactions. FP&A focuses on analysing financial information, forecasting future performance, and supporting strategic decisions."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why is FP&A important for growing businesses?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "As businesses grow, decision-making becomes more complex. FP&A provides management with the insights needed to plan effectively, allocate resources, and manage performance."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is FP&A only for large companies?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. SMEs and growing businesses can benefit significantly from FP&A because it creates financial discipline and improves decision-making during critical growth stages."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How does FP&A support CEOs and business owners?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "FP&A provides CEOs with clearer visibility into business performance, future expectations, risks, and opportunities."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Make Better Decisions With Better Financial Insight",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Growth requires more than ambition. It requires accurate information, structured planning, and the ability to anticipate what comes next."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses establish effective Financial Planning & Analysis (FP&A) frameworks that improve visibility, strengthen decision-making, and support sustainable growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are improving financial planning, preparing for expansion, or seeking greater control over business performance, SHAAS provides the financial insight required to move forward with confidence."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our FP&A services can support your business objectives."
      }
