       "type": "p",
       "text": "Corporate Finance Advisory helps businesses make strategic financial decisions related to funding, investments, capital structure, transactions, and value creation."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "How is Corporate Finance Advisory different from Fractional CFO Services?"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A Fractional CFO provides ongoing financial leadership and management support, while Corporate Finance Advisory focuses on specific strategic financial decisions such as funding, investments, restructuring, and transactions."
