    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What does investor readiness mean?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Investor readiness means preparing a business to meet investor expectations by strengthening strategy, financial information, documentation, and investment positioning."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "When should a business start preparing for fundraising?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Ideally, businesses should begin preparing before they urgently need funding. A structured fundraising process requires time to develop materials, identify investors, and build relationships."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS help startups raise investment?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS supports startups and growing businesses by helping them prepare investment materials, financial models, valuations, and fundraising strategies."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How much funding should a company raise?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The appropriate funding amount depends on business objectives, growth plans, cash requirements, and expected milestones."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does SHAAS directly introduce investors?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS primarily focuses on investor readiness, financial preparation, and strategic advisory. Where appropriate, businesses may be supported through relevant investor networks and relationships."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Transform Your Business Into an Investment Opportunity",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Investment opportunities are built on credibility, preparation, and a clear vision for growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses prepare for investors by strengthening their financial foundation, refining their investment proposition, and providing the strategic support required to navigate the fundraising journey."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are preparing for your first funding round, seeking growth capital, or positioning your business for strategic investment, SHAAS helps you approach investors with confidence."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Investor Readiness & Capital Raising Advisory Services can support your growth objectives."
      }
     ]
