       "type": "p",
       "text": "Providing a complete perspective for business leaders."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "What You Can Expect From SHAAS",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Depending on your requirements, deliverables may include:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Strategic assessment",
        "Business review",
        "Market analysis",
        "Strategic objectives",
        "Growth roadmap",
        "Strategic initiatives",
        "KPI framework",
        "Implementation plan",
        "Management presentation",
        "Strategy review sessions"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is strategic planning?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Strategic planning is the process of defining a company's long-term direction, setting priorities, and creating an actionable roadmap to achieve business objectives."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why is strategic planning important for SMEs?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SMEs often experience rapid changes and limited resources. Strategic planning helps them prioritise opportunities, allocate resources effectively, and build sustainable growth."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How often should a company review its strategy?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Businesses should regularly review their strategy, particularly when facing major changes such as expansion, market shifts, new competitors, or significant investments."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "What is the difference between strategic planning and business planning?"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Strategic planning focuses on long-term direction, competitive positioning, and major priorities. Business planning typically focuses more on operational execution and financial projections."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS help implement the strategy?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS focuses on practical execution and can support businesses in translating strategic plans into measurable initiatives."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Build a Clear Path Toward Sustainable Growth",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Without a clear strategy, businesses risk losing focus, misallocating resources, and missing valuable opportunities."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps CEOs and business leaders create structured strategic plans that align vision, resources, and execution toward long-term success."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are planning growth, entering new markets, transforming your business, or preparing for the next stage of development, SHAAS provides the strategic insight required to move forward with confidence."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Strategic Planning Services can help your business achieve its objectives."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
