    },
    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is the difference between budgeting and forecasting?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Budgeting sets financial targets and resource plans for a specific period, while forecasting estimates future performance based on current information and changing conditions."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do growing businesses need budgeting and forecasting?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "As businesses grow, financial decisions become more complex. Budgeting and forecasting provide better visibility, control, and planning capabilities."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How often should forecasts be updated?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The frequency depends on the business. Many growing companies benefit from monthly or quarterly forecast updates."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS help improve an existing budgeting process?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS can review current processes, improve financial models, and establish more effective budgeting frameworks."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is budgeting only about controlling costs?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. Effective budgeting supports growth by helping businesses allocate resources, evaluate opportunities, and achieve strategic objectives."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Plan With Confidence. Grow With Control."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Businesses that plan effectively are better prepared to manage uncertainty, capture opportunities, and achieve sustainable growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps CEOs and management teams develop practical budgets and forecasts that improve visibility, strengthen financial discipline, and support better business decisions."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are preparing your annual budget, improving forecasting accuracy, or building stronger financial planning processes, SHAAS provides the expertise required to plan for the future with confidence."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Budgeting & Forecasting Services can support your business growth."
      }
     ]
    }
