    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is business transformation?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Business transformation is the process of fundamentally improving how a company operates, competes, and creates value to achieve long-term success."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do businesses need transformation?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Businesses may require transformation due to growth, market disruption, operational challenges, technology changes, competition, or the need to improve performance."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is business transformation only for large companies?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. SMEs and growing businesses often benefit from transformation when they need to professionalise operations, scale effectively, or prepare for future growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "What is the difference between business transformation and business improvement?"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Business improvement focuses on enhancing specific areas of performance, while transformation involves broader changes to how the organisation operates and creates value."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS support transformation implementation?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS supports businesses by developing practical roadmaps, prioritising initiatives, and providing advisory support during implementation."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Transform Your Business for the Future",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The businesses that succeed in changing environments are those that continuously evolve."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps CEOs and leadership teams navigate transformation by improving strategy, operations, financial performance, and organisational capabilities."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are scaling your business, improving efficiency, adapting to market changes, or preparing for the future, SHAAS provides the strategic support required to transform challenges into opportunities."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Business Transformation Advisory Services can help your organisation evolve and grow."
      }
     ]
