    },
    {
     "heading": "Process Review & Improvement",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Internal audit is not only about identifying problems; it is about improving performance."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
