        "Identify inefficiencies",
        "Simplify workflows",
        "Improve accountability",
        "Strengthen execution"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Compliance & Policy Review",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Businesses require policies and procedures that reflect actual operations."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS supports:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
