      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Supporting stronger prevention measures."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Internal Audit Function Development",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Some businesses require support establishing an internal audit capability."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS can assist with:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
