    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is accounting advisory?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Accounting advisory helps businesses improve their accounting processes, financial reporting, systems, and finance function effectiveness."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How is accounting advisory different from bookkeeping?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Bookkeeping focuses on recording financial transactions, while accounting advisory focuses on improving the systems, processes, and structures that support financial management."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do growing businesses need accounting advisory?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "As businesses grow, accounting complexity increases. Advisory support helps ensure financial processes, systems, and reporting can support future growth."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS help improve existing accounting processes?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS can review current processes, identify weaknesses, and recommend improvements to enhance efficiency and reporting quality."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does accounting advisory support investor readiness?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. Strong accounting processes and reliable financial reporting improve credibility with investors, lenders, and other stakeholders."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Build a Stronger Financial Foundation",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Reliable financial information enables better decisions, stronger governance, and sustainable growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses improve accounting processes, strengthen financial reporting, and develop finance functions capable of supporting future success."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are improving reporting quality, preparing for growth, strengthening controls, or upgrading your finance function, SHAAS provides the expertise required to build a stronger financial foundation."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Accounting Advisory Services can support your business."
      }
     ]
