  {
   "title": "ESG & SUSTAINABILITY ADVISORY",
   "subtitle": "Helping Businesses Build Sustainable, Responsible, and Future-Ready Organisations",
   "sections": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) considerations are becoming increasingly important for businesses, investors, regulators, and stakeholders."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Companies are no longer evaluated only on financial performance. They are increasingly assessed on how they manage environmental impact, social responsibility, corporate governance, and long-term value creation."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "At SHAAS, we provide ESG & Sustainability Advisory Services in the UAE to help businesses understand ESG expectations, develop practical sustainability strategies, improve governance practices, and prepare for a future where responsible business practices are a key driver of competitiveness."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Our approach combines strategic advisory, financial insight, governance expertise, and business understanding to help organisations integrate sustainability into their growth strategy."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "What Is ESG & Sustainability Advisory?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "ESG represents three key areas that measure how businesses operate responsibly and sustainably:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Environmental (E)",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Focuses on how businesses manage their impact on the environment, including:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Resource efficiency",
        "Energy consumption",
        "Waste management",
        "Environmental risks",
        "Sustainability initiatives"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Social (S)",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Focuses on how businesses manage relationships with employees, customers, communities, and stakeholders, including:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Employee practices",
        "Workplace standards",
        "Diversity and inclusion",
        "Customer responsibility",
        "Social impact"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Governance (G)",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Focuses on how businesses are managed and controlled, including:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Corporate governance",
        "Ethical practices",
        "Risk management",
        "Board oversight",
        "Transparency and accountability"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Business Challenges We Help Solve",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We hear about ESG requirements, but we do not know where to start.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Many businesses understand that ESG is becoming important but lack clarity on what actions are required."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Understand ESG expectations",
        "Assess current practices",
        "Identify priorities",
        "Develop practical action plans"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"Our investors and stakeholders are asking about sustainability.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Investors, lenders, and customers increasingly consider ESG factors when evaluating businesses."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps companies improve readiness through:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "ESG assessments",
        "Sustainability frameworks",
        "Governance improvements",
        "ESG reporting preparation"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We want to improve governance and responsible business practices.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Strong governance is a critical part of sustainable growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS supports businesses in strengthening:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Governance structures",
        "Policies and procedures",
        "Risk management practices",
        "Accountability frameworks"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We need to understand our ESG risks and opportunities.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "ESG considerations can create both risks and opportunities."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses evaluate:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "ESG-related risks",
        "Operational impacts",
        "Stakeholder expectations",
        "Improvement opportunities"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "\"We want sustainability to support business growth, not become a compliance exercise.\""
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Effective ESG strategies should create business value."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps integrate sustainability into:"
      },
      {
       "type": "list",
       "items": [
        "Business strategy",
        "Operational improvement",
        "Risk management",
        "Long-term planning"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Our ESG & Sustainability Advisory Services",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "ESG Assessment & Gap Analysis",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses understand their current ESG position."
