    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is ESG?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "ESG stands for Environmental, Social, and Governance. It represents the factors used to evaluate how responsibly and sustainably a business operates."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why is ESG important for businesses?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "ESG can influence investor confidence, customer perception, regulatory readiness, operational resilience, and long-term business value."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is ESG only relevant for large companies?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. SMEs can benefit from establishing ESG foundations early, especially when preparing for growth, investment, or partnerships."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does ESG only focus on environmental issues?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. ESG covers environmental impact, social responsibility, and governance practices."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How can SHAAS help businesses start their ESG journey?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses assess their current position, identify priorities, develop practical strategies, and establish frameworks aligned with their objectives."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Build a Sustainable Business Prepared for the Future",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Sustainability is becoming an essential part of modern business strategy."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps organisations integrate ESG principles into their operations, governance, and growth plans to create long-term value for stakeholders."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are responding to investor expectations, improving governance, preparing for future requirements, or building a more responsible organisation, SHAAS provides the advisory support needed to move forward with confidence."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our ESG & Sustainability Advisory Services can support your business."
      }
     ]
