    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is a family office?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A family office is a structure established to manage and coordinate family wealth, investments, business interests, governance, and long-term objectives."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do family businesses need advisory support?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "As family businesses grow, they face increased complexity around governance, succession, ownership, and strategic decision-making."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is family office advisory only for billionaires?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. Family office principles can benefit many successful entrepreneurs and family businesses seeking better governance, planning, and long-term value preservation."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does SHAAS manage investments?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. SHAAS provides strategic, financial, and governance advisory support. Investment management services require appropriate regulated investment professionals."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "When should a family business consider succession planning?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Succession planning should ideally begin well before a leadership transition is required to ensure continuity and proper preparation."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Preserving Value. Strengthening Legacy. Preparing the Future."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Family businesses are built over generations, and protecting their future requires more than financial success."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps families establish stronger governance, improve strategic decision-making, and create structures that support sustainable growth and long-term continuity."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are preparing the next generation, professionalising your family business, or creating stronger oversight of your wealth and business interests, SHAAS provides the advisory expertise required to protect and enhance family value."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Family Office Advisory Services can support your long-term objectives."
      }
     ]
    }
