    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is business strategy consulting?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Business strategy consulting helps organisations define their direction, identify growth opportunities, improve competitiveness, and develop plans to achieve long-term objectives."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do companies need a business strategy consultant?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Companies seek strategy consultants when they need clarity, growth planning, market analysis, expansion support, or guidance through significant business decisions."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is business strategy consulting only for large companies?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. SMEs and growing businesses often benefit significantly from strategic planning to establish priorities and avoid inefficient growth decisions."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "How is business strategy consulting different from strategic planning?"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Strategic planning is one component of strategy consulting. Strategy consulting includes analysis, decision support, opportunity evaluation, and execution planning."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does SHAAS help implement the strategy?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS supports businesses beyond strategy development by helping create implementation plans and performance monitoring frameworks."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Turn Vision Into a Strategy for Growth",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A clear strategy provides the foundation for sustainable growth, stronger decision-making, and long-term business success."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps CEOs, founders, and leadership teams define their direction, identify opportunities, and build practical strategies that create measurable value."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are seeking growth, entering new markets, improving competitiveness, or preparing your organisation for the future, SHAAS provides the strategic expertise required to move forward with confidence."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Business Strategy Consulting Services can support your business objectives."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
