        "Business processes",
        "Resource utilisation",
        "Performance challenges",
        "Operational risks"
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Providing a clear view of improvement opportunities."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Process Improvement & Optimisation",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Efficient processes create stronger business performance."
