    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is operational excellence consulting?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Operational excellence consulting helps businesses improve efficiency, optimise processes, reduce waste, and create operating models that support sustainable performance."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "What is the difference between operational excellence and process optimisation?"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Process optimisation focuses on improving specific workflows, while operational excellence focuses on improving the overall capability of the organisation to operate efficiently and continuously improve."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do growing businesses need operational excellence?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "As companies grow, inefficient processes and unclear structures can reduce profitability and limit scalability. Operational excellence helps businesses build stronger foundations."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is operational excellence only relevant for manufacturing companies?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. Operational excellence applies to all industries, including professional services, technology, healthcare, real estate, retail, and financial services."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS help implement operational improvements?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS supports businesses from assessment through implementation and performance monitoring."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Build an Organisation Designed for Sustainable Performance",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Operational excellence enables businesses to become more efficient, agile, and prepared for future growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps organisations improve processes, optimise resources, strengthen accountability, and build operating models that support long-term success."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are experiencing operational challenges, preparing for expansion, or seeking improved profitability, SHAAS provides the expertise required to enhance how your business operates."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Operational Excellence Consulting Services can support your organisation."
      }
     ]
    }
