    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is change management consulting?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Change management consulting helps organisations successfully implement business changes by addressing strategy, communication, leadership alignment, and employee adoption."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do change initiatives fail?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Common reasons include poor communication, lack of leadership alignment, insufficient employee engagement, and failure to manage organisational impact."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "When should a company involve a change management consultant?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Ideally, change management should begin at the early planning stage of any major transformation, restructuring, system implementation, or organisational change."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is change management only for large organisations?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. SMEs and growing businesses also experience significant change and benefit from structured approaches to managing transitions."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How is change management different from business transformation?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Business transformation focuses on what needs to change in the organisation, while change management focuses on ensuring people and processes successfully adopt and sustain that change."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Turn Change Into Sustainable Progress",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Successful organisations are not those that avoid change; they are those that manage change effectively."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses navigate transformation by aligning leadership, engaging stakeholders, and creating structured approaches that ensure change delivers lasting value."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are restructuring your organisation, implementing new systems, transforming operations, or pursuing growth initiatives, SHAAS provides the expertise required to make change successful."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Change Management Consulting Services can support your organisation."
      }
     ]
    }
