    },
    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is organisation design?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Organisation design is the process of structuring a business so that people, responsibilities, processes, and decision-making are aligned with strategic objectives."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do growing companies need organisation design?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "As businesses grow, informal structures often create inefficiencies. Organisation design helps establish clarity, accountability, and scalability."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is the difference between organisation design and HR consulting?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Organisation design focuses on how the business is structured and operates, while HR consulting often focuses on people-related policies, recruitment, compensation, and employee management."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "When should a company redesign its organisation?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Companies often consider organisation redesign during periods of growth, restructuring, transformation, expansion, or significant changes in strategy."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS support implementation after redesign?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS can support businesses with implementation planning, change management, and leadership alignment."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Build an Organisation Ready for the Future",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A successful strategy requires an organisation capable of executing it."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses design effective structures, clarify accountability, strengthen leadership alignment, and build organisational capabilities that support sustainable growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are scaling, restructuring, improving performance, or preparing for the future, SHAAS provides the expertise required to build a stronger organisation."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Organisation Design & Development Services can support your business."
      }
     ]
    }
