    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is PMO support?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "PMO support helps organisations establish structures, processes, and governance frameworks to improve project planning, execution, and monitoring."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why do projects fail?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Common reasons include unclear objectives, poor planning, weak governance, insufficient resources, and lack of stakeholder alignment."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does a company need a PMO for every project?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. PMO support is most valuable for organisations managing multiple strategic initiatives, complex projects, or transformation programmes."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is the difference between project management and PMO advisory?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Project management focuses on managing a specific project, while PMO advisory focuses on improving the overall project management framework, governance, and execution capability of the organisation."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS manage projects directly?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. Depending on requirements, SHAAS can provide advisory support, PMO setup, project monitoring, or execution support for selected strategic initiatives."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Turn Strategic Plans Into Successful Execution",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A strategy without execution remains only an ambition."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps organisations create the governance, discipline, and visibility required to successfully deliver strategic initiatives and achieve measurable business outcomes."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are managing a transformation programme, expansion initiative, technology implementation, or operational improvement project, SHAAS provides the expertise required to improve execution and deliver results."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Project Management Advisory and PMO Support Services can help your organisation achieve its objectives."
      }
     ]
    }
