       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are scaling, restructuring, integrating a business, or preparing for the next stage of growth, SHAAS provides the expertise to help you build the organisational foundation required for success."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Organisation Design & Workforce Structuring Advisory Services can support your business."
