    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why does a business need HR policies?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "HR policies provide clear guidelines for managing employees, improving consistency, reducing risks, and creating a professional workplace environment."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does every company need an Employee Handbook?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "While requirements vary, an Employee Handbook is highly beneficial for businesses that want to establish clear expectations, improve employee communication, and standardise workplace practices."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How often should HR policies be updated?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "HR policies should be reviewed periodically and whenever there are significant business, workforce, or regulatory changes."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS prepare HR policies for startups and SMEs?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS supports businesses at different growth stages, from startups establishing their first HR framework to larger organisations improving existing documentation."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Are HR policies the same as employment contracts?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. Employment contracts define the legal relationship between employer and employee, while HR policies establish workplace rules, procedures, and organisational practices."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Build a Professional HR Foundation for Your Business",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A strong organisation starts with clear expectations, consistent processes, and professional workforce management."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses create HR policies, procedures, and employee handbooks that support compliance, improve employee experience, and provide the foundation required for sustainable growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are establishing your first HR framework, formalising existing practices, or improving workforce governance, SHAAS provides practical HR advisory solutions tailored to your organisation."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our HR Policies, Procedures & Employee Handbook Services can support your business."
      }
