    },
    {
     "heading": "How is executive search different from traditional recruitment?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Traditional recruitment often focuses on responding to open vacancies, while executive search involves proactive identification and engagement of suitable candidates, including those who may not be actively seeking opportunities."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Does SHAAS only recruit executives?",
