    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is a KPI framework?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A KPI framework is a structured system that defines, measures, and monitors key objectives and performance indicators across an organisation."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why are KPIs important for businesses?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "KPIs help organisations measure progress, improve accountability, align employees with business objectives, and make better management decisions."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How often should employee performance be reviewed?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The frequency depends on the organisation, but many businesses benefit from quarterly check-ins combined with annual performance reviews."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "What makes a good KPI?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Effective KPIs should be measurable, relevant, aligned with business objectives, achievable, and focused on meaningful outcomes."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS help design KPIs for different departments?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS develops KPI frameworks across functions including finance, operations, sales, HR, technology, and management teams."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Create a Culture of Performance and Accountability",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "High-performing organisations are built when employees understand expectations, measure progress, and see how their contribution creates business value."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps organisations establish performance management systems that align people with strategy, improve accountability, and create measurable results."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are building your first KPI framework, improving an existing performance system, or creating a stronger performance culture, SHAAS provides the expertise to help your organisation achieve more."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Performance Management & KPI Framework Services can support your business growth."
      }
     ]
