    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is talent management?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Talent management is the strategic process of attracting, developing, engaging, and retaining employees who contribute to organisational success."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why is succession planning important?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Succession planning helps businesses prepare future leaders, reduce key-person dependency, and maintain continuity when important roles become vacant."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "When should a company start succession planning?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Succession planning should begin before a critical need arises. Businesses of all sizes benefit from identifying future leaders and preparing internal talent."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Is succession planning only for large companies?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "No. Succession planning is valuable for SMEs, family businesses, and startups, especially where key individuals have significant influence over operations."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How does talent management improve business performance?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Effective talent management improves employee capability, retention, leadership strength, and organisational readiness for growth."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Build the Leaders Who Will Shape Your Future",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "A successful organisation is not built only on today’s workforce; it is built on the ability to develop tomorrow’s leaders."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses create structured talent strategies, develop future leadership capabilities, and establish succession frameworks that support continuity and sustainable growth."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are preparing for expansion, strengthening leadership capability, or planning the future of your organisation, SHAAS provides the expertise required to build a resilient talent pipeline."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Talent Management & Succession Planning Services can support your organisation."
