    {
     "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
     "blocks": []
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why is leadership development important?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Leadership development helps organisations build capable leaders who can improve performance, manage teams effectively, and support business growth."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How can learning programmes improve business performance?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Effective learning programmes close capability gaps, improve employee effectiveness, increase engagement, and strengthen organisational performance."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Should SMEs invest in leadership development?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. Developing leaders early helps SMEs scale effectively and reduces dependency on founders or a small number of key individuals."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "What is the difference between training and leadership development?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Training focuses on improving specific skills, while leadership development focuses on building broader capabilities, behaviours, and decision-making abilities required for future responsibilities."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Can SHAAS design customised leadership programmes?",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Yes. SHAAS develops tailored leadership and capability frameworks based on each organisation’s objectives and workforce needs."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "Develop the Leaders Who Will Drive Your Growth",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Organisations that invest in their people build stronger foundations for sustainable success."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "SHAAS helps businesses develop leadership capability, strengthen workforce skills, and create learning strategies that prepare employees for current challenges and future opportunities."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Whether you are developing your next generation of leaders, improving management capability, or building a learning culture, SHAAS provides the expertise to help your organisation grow."
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Contact SHAAS today to discuss how our Learning & Leadership Development Services can support your business."
      }
